<!-- The Radio tab and the Reciters tab. Edit both lists before you build; add or drop lines freely.

     stations: "name | stream URL". The name is shown as written. The URL must be https (Android blocks
     plain http). Every station of mp3quran.net's radio list is at
     https://www.mp3quran.net/api/v3/radios?language=ar (the stream is the "url" field).

     reciters: "reciter id | note". The id is the reciter's "id" at
     https://www.mp3quran.net/api/v3/reciters?language=ar and the note after | is only for you. When the
     reciter has several recitations (moshaf), the first one is played; write "id:moshaf" to pick one, with
     the moshaf's own "id" from the same list. The recitation's riwayah is part of the name shown on the
     screen. The riwayat list is at https://www.mp3quran.net/api/v3/riwayat: 1 Hafs, 13 Al-Douri (Abu Amr). -->
